                    },
                    "message": "This function could return vector of state sensor pdrs. Any reason why vector of vector is chosen"
                },
                {
                    "file": "common/utils.hpp",
                    "line": 522,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Pavithra Barithaya",
                        "email": "pavithrabarithaya07@gmail.com",
                        "username": "Pavithrab7"
                    },
                    "message": "yes, std::vector<pldm::pdr::Pdr_t> \u2014 a single PDR.\nstd::vector<std::vector<pldm::pdr::Pdr_t>> \u2014 a list of PDRs.\nThis should return a vector of PDR blobs (each a std::vector<uint8_t>)\nThat is why we chose a vector of vectors."
